# KayTech Africa footer credit

For every site or app we build unless the client explicitly asks otherwise:

- Add a visible footer line: **Built by KayTech Africa**, linking to `https://www.kaytechafrica.com` (also show `www.kaytechafrica.com` if it fits the design).
- Style it smaller and quieter than the client copyright; keep it on every page via the shared layout footer.
- Do **not** add this credit when the user or PRD says to omit KayTech branding, white-label, or use different attribution.